202:     /** 调用方已持有重置租约并记录意图；多段复盘按自然对话逐条发送，网络等待不占受理锁。 */
203:     @Override
204:     public butvan.agent.agents.review.PersonalDeliveryPort.Attempt send(String expected, String deliveryId, String text) {
205:         FeishuMessageSender sender;
206:         String recipient;
207:         boolean pauseBetweenSegments;
208:         synchronized (this) {
209:             var target = target();
210:             if (!target.available() || !target.fingerprint().equals(expected)
211:                     || (resetBarrier != null && resetBarrier.blocked()))
212:                 return new butvan.agent.agents.review.PersonalDeliveryPort.Attempt("FAILED", "");
213:             sender = personalSender;
214:             recipient = config.allowedSenderIds().getFirst();
215:             pauseBetweenSegments = scheduler != null;
216:         }
217:         List<String> segments = text == null ? List.of()
218:                 : Arrays.stream(text.split("\\n\\n+")).map(String::strip).filter(s -> !s.isEmpty()).toList();
219:         if (segments.isEmpty()) segments = List.of(text == null ? "" : text);
220:         String lastMessageId = "";
221:         for (int i = 0; i < segments.size(); i++) {
222:             if (i > 0 && pauseBetweenSegments) {
223:                 try { Thread.sleep(350); }
224:                 catch (InterruptedException e) { Thread.currentThread().interrupt(); break; }
225:             }
226:             String partId = i == 0 ? deliveryId : stableId(deliveryId + ":" + i);
227:             var result = sender.sendToOwner(recipient, partId, segments.get(i));
228:             if (result.status() != FeishuMessageSender.Status.SENT) {
229:                 return new butvan.agent.agents.review.PersonalDeliveryPort.Attempt(
230:                         result.status() == FeishuMessageSender.Status.UNKNOWN || i > 0 ? "UNKNOWN" : "FAILED",
231:                         lastMessageId);
232:             }
233:             lastMessageId = result.messageId() == null ? "" : result.messageId();
234:         }
235:         return new butvan.agent.agents.review.PersonalDeliveryPort.Attempt("SENT", lastMessageId);
236:     }
